                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nao wataomboleza kwa sauti juu yako, nao watalia kwa uchungu, na kutupa mavumbi juu ya vichwa vyao, na kugaagaa katika majivu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao watajifanya kuwa na upaa kwa ajili yako, na kujifunga nguo za magunia viunoni, nao watakulilia kwa uchungu wa roho, kwa maombolezo ya uchungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na katika kulia kwao watakufanyia maombolezo, na kukuombolezea, wakisema, Ni nani aliye kama Tiro, kama yeye aliyenyamazishwa kati ya bahari? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bidhaa zako zilipotoka katika bahari, uliwajaza watu wa kabila nyingi; uliwatajirisha wafalme wa dunia, kwa wingi wa mali zako, na kwa utajiri wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati ulipovunjwa na bahari, katika vilindi vya maji, bidhaa zako na jeshi lako lote walianguka kati yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
